{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DAUGHTER OF PAIN&quot;<i>is a top-down action game with Roguelike elements, developed solely by &quot;Yu Bu Yan Tian&quot; (a literal transliteration of the developer's name). The protagonist is a young girl nicknamed &quot;Daughter of Sorrow&quot; by netizens. She gains inspiration by fighting monsters that embody pain in her nightmares; after waking up, she turns the painful stories submitted by netizens into paintings. These paintings gradually gain traction online, and the girl herself searches for her lost memories through repeated cycles.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3338240?t=1755904903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755904903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338240/a0d571483c4e5787cf1972c5f3e8d455fb9c7cb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755904903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338240/a0d571483c4e5787cf1972c5f3e8d455fb9c7cb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755904903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DAUGHTER OF PAIN&quot;<i>is a top-down action game with Roguelike elements, developed solely by &quot;Yu Bu Yan Tian&quot; (a literal transliteration of the developer's name). The protagonist is a young girl nicknamed &quot;Daughter of Sorrow&quot; by netizens. She gains inspiration by fighting monsters that embody pain in her nightmares; after waking up, she turns the painful stories submitted by netizens into paintings. These paintings gradually gain traction online, and the girl herself searches for her lost memories through repeated cycles.</i></p>","developers":["Yuburitian"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1